cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar o PO Studio em aulas ou trabalhos, cite assim. If you use PO Studio, please cite it as below."
title: "PO Studio: pesquisa operacional passo a passo"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jorge
    family-names: Camargo
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/16Jorgecamargo/po-studio"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  PO Studio solves operations research problems step by step, on the desktop
  (Rust and egui) or in the browser (Rust compiled to WebAssembly). It covers
  linear systems, matrix inversion, linear programming with the simplex method
  (all-slack, Big M, two-phase, dual simplex, sensitivity analysis and the
  graphical method), integer programming by Branch and Bound, the
  transportation problem, minimum spanning tree, shortest path, maximum flow,
  CPM, PERT, queueing models and zero-sum games.
keywords:
  - operations research
  - pesquisa operacional
  - linear programming
  - simplex method
  - integer programming
  - branch and bound
  - transportation problem
  - network optimization
  - CPM
  - PERT
  - queueing theory
  - game theory
  - education
